PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786162661
OL,3,CMeghan shares how daughter Lilibet
OL,4,Cmakes her feel 'brave'
OL,6,FThe documentary, which had its
OL,7,Fpremiere at the 2026 Sundance Film
OL,8,FFestival, follows "four tenacious
OL,9,Fgirls (who) strive to be a top-selling
OL,10,F'Cookie Queen', navigating an 800
OL,11,Fmillion dollar business in which
OL,12,Fchildhood and ambition collide".
OL,14,FIn January, Meghan, 45, delivered a
OL,15,Fspeech at Sundance in support of the
OL,16,Fproject, directed by Alysa Nahmias,
OL,17,Fwhich she called a "powerful and
OL,18,Fmeaningful depiction of something that
OL,19,Fis an American tradition".
OL,26,@pD@SOUtD@_O]yD@TOU{D@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786162661
OL,3,CMeghan shares how daughter Lilibet
OL,4,Cmakes her feel 'brave'
OL,6,F"This film is probably the cutest at
OL,7,Fthe festival but I'm also going to go
OL,8,Fout on a limb and say it is one of the
OL,9,Fmost powerful and meaningful
OL,10,Fdepictions of something that is an
OL,11,FAmerican tradition and rooted in
OL,12,Fnostalgia," she said at the time.
OL,14,F"It is now put through this lens from
OL,15,Fthe incredible creative vision of
OL,16,FAlysa to show something modernised
OL,17,Fabout the girlhood experience and all
OL,18,Fthe layers of complexity that come
OL,19,Fwith that.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@KO]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
